    <guid isPermaLink="false">677c56b3cda04ef4c1dad2ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jan 2025 23:03:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 歌曲推荐 - 来自香港歌手gordon flanders的一首粤语歌《冬天一个游》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>R&amp;B/流行</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>贴合圣诞+新年的节日氛围</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>港式情歌</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luy25_prDYuh1_WJtTqBF2ZbGv0u.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 过去一周干了啥</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>去德国吃饭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>邀请华裔和埃及朋友来家里做客，了解到清真肉类和普通肉类的区别以及穆斯林斋月的相关情况</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>7周年纪念日大餐</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrwFh5FiH-RYorjTvlETxP1-Fxhx.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>跟舅舅一起的跨年，被烟花吓到的狗子</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsLRB5qE5Mg0kli8YzW1LYfn3Sjf.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>元旦跟老邻居相聚，跟健身教练一起遛狗，为2024做出总结</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>愿你的新年像我们过去一周吃过的食物一样丰富多彩～</span></strong></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>联系邮箱：ukerellen@gmail.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
