  <item>
    <title>宽周记01｜从布鲁昔《晚安吻》到快乐不止的圣诞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676e6b9315a5fd520e07f15c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676e6b9315a5fd520e07f15c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Dec 2024 09:18:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开通频道的初衷</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>近期再次听到在美国留学时通过喜马拉雅录制的播客，当时的点点滴滴搭载几年前的声音穿越时间再次在耳机里响起，独特的声音日记激励我在小宇宙这个平台重新开始，以周记的方式分享异国文化冲击下的每周趣事和感想，并且推荐一些我所欣赏的小众歌曲。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 本期音乐分享：来自广东佛山独立音乐人</span><strong><span>布鲁昔</span></strong><span>的</span><strong><span>《晚安吻》</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk0rK9MQDbpXrtqNoVyvjrT39hzL.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">09:19</a> 被圣诞氛围笼罩的过去一周 （以公司圣诞活动为主）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公司传统——drive through领取圣诞礼物</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大姐分享生日蛋糕</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>领取Secret Santa为我准备的圣诞礼物</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>办公楼的圣诞午餐</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoY5K4hOTZdcdLYfvC9pjna2KuFg.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>周三快乐继续：趁另一大姐生日，团队圣诞party</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>今年我是如何过圣诞的</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs28DAIIVMN-jpnnggj3yJk7Q4oy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>愿你的快乐不止圣诞</span></strong></em><span>🎄</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>联系邮箱：ukerellen@gmail.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqHPcY19ex2H3TQA97DxclXlr_8A.m4a" length="28220291" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPIKrtVCmpQMS_C94V9byJNV5S5.png"/>
